<title>UK: BIG sets 150 million Swiss franc seven-year bond.</title>
<headline>BIG sets 150 million Swiss franc seven-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager Credit Suisse.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BUNDESIMMOBILIEN GESELLSCHAFT</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN SFR   COUPON     3.75 PCT  MATURITY    25.NOV.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.50    PAY DATE    25.NOV.96</p>
<p> LISTING    EBS	 DENOMS     5-100     EOS	   12.NOV.96</p>
<p> NOTES	100 PERCENT OWNED BY AUSTRIA</p>
<p>		51.0 PCT SHARE MAINTENANCE CLAUSE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
